# Pairs with RStrictIsolation. The receiver records every terminal as a commit,
# whatever outcome it carries, so an aborted saga's tally completes as
# committed and its staged buckets surface post-saga on the receiver - a saga
# the origin aborted, made visible.
MODULE: RStrictIsolationTerminalOutcomeIgnored
TARGET: RStrictIsolation
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the receiver records every terminal as a commit, so an aborted saga surfaces
PERTURBS: DeliverTerminal

--- FIND
           o == Outcome(m.commit)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the terminal's outcome is ignored.
           o == "committed"
--- END
